<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="note">部分图片暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新。商品和订单信息以文字为准。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取好物…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">重新读取</button><button class="text-button" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">前往我的</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="brand-line"><text class="brand-mark">陇</text><view><text class="eyebrow">LONGSHANG FRESH</text><text class="brand-name">把家乡的好味道，带到身边</text></view></view><view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow light">从甘肃 · 景泰出发</text><text class="hero-title">一方水土
一口家乡</text><text class="hero-copy">跟着采购者看产地，按需挑选每份好物。</text><button class="hero-button" data-page="regions" bindtap="go">去看家乡产区 →</button></view><view class="search-line"><input value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="search" confirm-type="search" placeholder="搜苹果、枸杞、土豆…" maxlength="40"/><button bindtap="search">搜索</button></view><view class="quick-links"><button data-page="shops" bindtap="go"><text class="quick-symbol">田</text>采购者店铺</button><button data-page="orders" bindtap="go"><text class="quick-symbol">单</text>我的订单</button><button data-page="guide" bindtap="go"><text class="quick-symbol">试</text>完整体验指南</button></view><view class="section-title"><view><text class="eyebrow">JINGTAI SELECTION</text><text class="heading">景泰当季好物</text></view><button class="text-button" bindtap="all">全部 {{count}} 款</button></view><view class="product-grid"><view wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" class="product-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openProduct"><image binderror="imageFailed" class="product-image" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="product-copy"><text class="product-title">{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted small">{{item.origin}}</text><view class="price-line"><text class="price">¥{{item.priceText}}</text><text class="muted small">起 · 模拟</text></view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!products.length}}" class="empty">暂时没有匹配的商品，换个词试试。</view><view class="note">商品、产地、规格、价格均为模拟资料。图片为示意，尚未上传的采收视频会显示待补充。</view></view><view class="bottom-space"></view></view>
